.dockerignore

# Secrets and local state must never reach an image layer. The Dockerfile does
# `COPY . .`, so anything not excluded here is baked into every published tag
# and survives in the layer history even if a later step deletes it.
# config/ holds Google service-account private keys; data/ is ~77MB of local
# scrape artefacts from the retired sheet pipeline.
config/
data/
backups/
.env.*
